# BANNERFALL: one unit a turn each, plus the host's extra percentage as a
# running total; matching pools spawn matching units; the timer counts from
# 9, then 6 in Double Time and 4 in Triple Time.
game bannerfall
wait 5
cheat battle 2
expect matched == 0
expect handicap == 50
cheat clear
cheat spawn
expect count_r == 2
expect count_l == 1
cheat clear
cheat spawn
expect count_r == 1
cheat battle 5
expect matched == 1
expect timer == 9
cheat turn 40
expect timer == 6
cheat turn 60
expect timer == 4
